Musebook additions, restructuring, Solana Agent Kit integration, and
documentation are copyright (c) 2026 Musebook.

On-chain program IDs for the deployed AgentRegistry8004 and ATOM Engine
programs are retained so this SDK stays protocol-compatible with existing
8004 deployments. See docs/PROGRAMS.md.
